flowchart TD
    ISSUE[notification problem] --> WHAT{which system?}
    WHAT -->|message lost on dismiss| INBOX[inbox is the record - SSOT + sync]
    WHAT -->|spam / app muted| GROUP[group + correct channel importance]
    WHAT -->|not shown Android 13+| PERM[request POST_NOTIFICATIONS - inbox still works]
